Growth becomes meaningful when it turns aspiration into opportunity. Speaking at the News18 Rising Bharat Summit - West Edition, Sumant Rampal of HDFC Bank underscored the growing importance of India's self-employed workforce and MSMEs in shaping the country's future. As entrepreneurial ambitions rise, demand for better homes, stronger communities and greater financial access is creating powerful momentum across the economy.

Discover more perspectives on the aspirations, opportunities and growth stories shaping Rising Bharat.

