Every great business starts with one problem solved exceptionally well.

At the News18 Rising Bharat Summit - West Edition, Niraj Singh of Spinny challenged conventional startup wisdom by focusing on what comes before growth. In a world obsessed with speed, the ability to understand customers deeply and solve their problems meaningfully remains the most powerful competitive advantage. Follow the conversation as we decode the trends defining a Rising Bharat.

