When millions adopt technology, economies begin to move differently.

At the News18 Rising Bharat Summit - West Edition, Hemant Gala of PhonePe Lending, highlighted how digital transactions have become a reflection of economic confidence, participation and scale. As more consumers and businesses embrace digital payments, India's growth story is increasingly being written through millions of everyday financial interactions.

